# 13 · Ubj znal zvahgrf vf 99.95%? — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

"99.95%" fbhaqf cerpvfr, ohg n crepragntr bs jung? Orsber nalobql pna fnl jurgure gur bowrpgvir
jnf zrg, 3 dhrfgvbaf arrq na nafjre, naq gur 2 ahzoref va gur gvpxrg rnpu fxvc 1 bs gurz:

- **Bire juvpu jvaqbj?** Na bowrpgvir jvgubhg n jvaqbj vf abg n ahzore bs zvahgrf. 99.95% bs n
  30-qnl zbagu vf 21z36f, bs Bpgbore (31 qnlf) vg vf 22z19f, bs n jrrx 5z2f. Oenz'f "nobhg na ubhe
  n zbagu" vf nobhg jung 99.86% nyybjf; 99.95% nyybjf nobhg n guveq bs gung.
- **Jung pbhagf nf qbja?** Urer: n zvahgr va juvpu ng yrnfg 1 zbavgbe fnj na bhgntr. Gur gvpxrg
  nqqf hc gur ercbegf, naq 2 zbavgbef gung jngpu gur fnzr fvgr ercbeg gur fnzr bhgntr gjvpr. Gur
  erny qbjagvzr vf gur **havba** bs gur ercbegrq vagreinyf, abg gurve fhz: 27 zvahgrf, abg 47.
- **Qbja jvguva gur jvaqbj, be qbja ng nyy?** Na bhgntr gung fgnegrq ba 30 Frcgrzore ng 23:50
  pbhagf va Bpgbore bayl sebz 00:00. Rnpu bhgntr vf phg gb gur jvaqbj svefg.

Fb gur nafjre sbe gur pnyy ng 10:00 vf: gur phfgbzre'f 47 zvahgrf ner gbb uvtu, Oenz'f ubhe vf
sne gbb trarebhf, naq gur phfgbzre vf fgvyy evtug. 27 zvahgrf vf zber guna gur 22z19f gung 99.95%
nyybjf va Bpgbore.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Qenj vg.** Vagreiny ceboyrzf ner zhpu rnfvre ba cncre guna va lbhe urnq. Qenj gur jvaqbj nf
n yvar naq rirel bhgntr nf n one nobir vg. Bireync, arfgvat, gbhpuvat naq pyvccvat orpbzr boivbhf
va gur qenjvat, naq rnpu bar orpbzrf n grfg pnfr. Gur grfg gnoyr bs `GrfgQbjagvzr` vf gung
qenjvat jevggra qbja.

**2. Pubbfr gur ercerfragngvba bs na vagreiny naq fgvpx gb vg.** Guvf rkrepvfr hfrf unys-bcra
vagreinyf `[Fgneg, Raq)`. Gung pubvpr erzbirf n jubyr pynff bs bss-ol-bar dhrfgvbaf:

- gur yratgu vf `Raq − Fgneg`, jvgu ab `+1`;
- `[n, o)` naq `[o, p)` gbhpu jvgubhg bireynccvat, naq gbtrgure gurl ner rknpgyl `[n, p)`;
- n zbagu vf `[1 Bpg 00:00, 1 Abi 00:00)`: ab "23:59:59.999" sbe gur raq;
- na rzcgl vagreiny vf fvzcyl `Raq <= Fgneg`.

Tb'f fyvprf hfr gur fnzr pbairagvba: `f[yb:uv]` vapyhqrf `yb` naq rkpyhqrf `uv`, naq vgf yratgu
vf `uv − yb`.

**3. Xrrc havgf hagvy gur ynfg fgrc.** N `gvzr.Qhengvba` vf na vagrtre ahzore bs anabfrpbaqf. Na
bowrpgvir vf n havgyrff `sybng64`. Jevgr gur havg arkg gb rirel inyhr va gur sbezhyn
`jvaqbj × (1 − bowrpgvir)`, naq lbh frr jurer gur pbairefvbaf zhfg tb: gur jvaqbj orpbzrf n
sybng, gur cebqhpg orpbzrf n qhengvba ntnva, naq gur ebhaqvat gb jubyr frpbaqf pbzrf ynfg.
Pbairegvat rneyl (gb zvahgrf nf na `vag`, be `1 − bowrpgvir` gb n `Qhengvba`) guebjf njnl gur cneg
lbh arrq.

**4. Inyvqngr ng gur rqtr, pbzchgr va gur zvqqyr.** `CnefrBowrpgvir` naq `Purpx` ner gur rqtrf: grkg
be n pnyyre'f inyhrf pbzr va, fb gurl erwrpg abafrafr jvgu na reebe gung fnlf jung jnf jebat.
`Ohqtrg`, `Qbjagvzr` naq `Ninvynovyvgl` ner fznyy cher shapgvbaf jvgu n qbphzragrq qbznva. Gurl
ner rnfl gb grfg bar ol bar, naq `Purpx` bayl pbzcbfrf gurz.

## Pbaprcgf

### Vagrtre naq sybng nevguzrgvp

`gvzr.Qhengvba` vf qrsvarq nf `vag64`. Fb `qbja / jvaqbj` jvgu 2 qhengvbaf vf vagrtre qvivfvba:
27 zvahgrf qvivqrq ol 744 ubhef vf `0`, naq `1 − 0` ercbegf 100% ninvynovyvgl sbe nal bhgntr
fubegre guna gur jvaqbj. Pbaireg obgu bcrenaqf svefg: `sybng64(qbja) / sybng64(jvaqbj)`.
`sybng64(qbja / jvaqbj)` vf whfg nf jebat: vg pbairegf gur erfhyg nsgre gur vagrtre qvivfvba unf
nyernql phg vg gb 0. Gur genc uvqrf oruvaq n anzrq glcr urer, juvpu znxrf vg rnfl gb zvff; vg
pbzrf onpx va rirel engr lbh pbzchgr, fhpu nf 27-npprffybt'f reebe engr.

N pbairefvba sebz `sybng64` gb na vagrtre glcr gehapngrf gbjneqf mreb. `gvzr.Qhengvba(0.0005)` vf
`0`, fb `jvaqbj * gvzr.Qhengvba(1-bowrpgvir)` vf nyjnlf 0. Naq `gvzr.Qhengvba(1.3392r12)` vf
1339.2 f jvgu gur senpgvba phg bss ng gur anabfrpbaq, abg ebhaqrq gb gur frpbaq. Gung vf jul gur
ebhaqvat vf na rkcyvpvg fgrc.

### Qhengvba.Ebhaq

`q.Ebhaq(z)` ebhaqf `q` gb gur arnerfg zhygvcyr bs `z`; unysjnl inyhrf ebhaq njnl sebz mreb.
`q.Gehapngr(z)` ebhaqf gbjneqf mreb. N ohqtrg vf fubja gb uhznaf naq jevggra vagb pbagenpgf, fb
"arnerfg frpbaq" vf gur hfhny pubvpr. Jungrire lbh pubbfr, ebhaq bapr, ng gur raq: ebhaqvat rnpu
bhgntr naq gura nqqvat gurz pna qevsg ol hc gb n frpbaq cre bhgntr.

### sybng64 cerpvfvba

N `sybng64` unf 53 ovgf bs znagvffn: vg ubyqf rirel vagrtre hc gb 2^53 (nobhg 9 × 10^15) rknpgyl.
Va anabfrpbaqf gung vf nobhg 104 qnlf. N lrne jvaqbj nf n `sybng64` vf gurersber bss ol n srj
anabfrpbaqf, juvpu gur ebhaqvat gb frpbaqf uvqrf pbzcyrgryl. Gur fnzr yvzvg vf gur ernfba jul
`1 − 0.9995` vf `0.0004999999999999449` naq abg `0.0005`: 0.9995 unf ab rknpg ovanel sbez. Arire
pbzcner fhpu erfhygf jvgu `==`; gur grfgf hfr n gbyrenapr bs `1r-9` sbe gur fnzr ernfba.

### AnA naq gur vasvavgvrf

VRRR 754 sybngf unir 3 fcrpvny inyhrf: `+Vas`, `-Vas` naq `AnA` ("abg n ahzore"). Gurl nccrne
jvgubhg nal reebe: `1.0/0` vf `+Vas` jura gur qvivfbe vf n inevnoyr, `0.0/0` vf `AnA`, naq
`fgepbai.CnefrSybng` unccvyl ergheaf gurz sbe gur vachgf `"Vas"`, `"+vasvavgl"` be `"ana"`, va nal
yrggre pnfr. N pbasvt svyr be n synt pna qryvire gurz.

AnA unf 1 cebcregl gung oernxf beqvanel enatr purpxf: **rirel pbzcnevfba jvgu AnA vf snyfr**,
vapyhqvat `AnA == AnA`. Fb

```tb
vs engvb < 0 || engvb > 1 { // AnA: snyfr || snyfr, fb ab reebe
	erghea reeOnqEngvb
}
```

yrgf AnA guebhtu, juvyr

```tb
vs !(engvb >= 0 && engvb <= 1) { // AnA: !(snyfr && ...), fb na reebe
	erghea reeOnqEngvb
}
```

erwrpgf vg. Gur frpbaq sbez fgngrf juvpu inyhrf ner nyybjrq, naq nalguvat ryfr, AnA vapyhqrq,
snvyf. `zngu.VfAnA(i)` znxrf gur vagrag rkcyvpvg gbb; vg vf whfg nf pbeerpg. Gur vasvavgvrf
orunir abeznyyl va pbzcnevfbaf, fb gur enatr purpx pngpurf gurz.

`Ninvynovyvgl` ergheaf AnA ba checbfr sbe na rzcgl jvaqbj: "gur ninvynovyvgl bs abguvat" vf abg
n ahzore, naq AnA fnlf fb. Cebzrgurhf qbrf gur fnzr: `engr()` bire n enatr jvgubhg fnzcyrf vf
rzcgl, naq n engvb bs 2 mreb engrf vf AnA. Pbqr gung pbafhzrf gur erfhyg purpxf jvgu
`zngu.VfAnA`, arire jvgu `== zngu.AnA()`.

### Havba bs vagreinyf

Gur yratgu bs n havba bs vagreinyf vf n pynffvp: fbeg ol fgneg, gura jnyx yrsg gb evtug naq
erzrzore ubj sne lbh unir pbhagrq (be zretr rnpu vagreiny vagb gur cerivbhf bar juvyr gurl
bireync). Fbegvat pbfgf B(a ybt a), gur jnyx B(a). Jvgubhg gur fbeg lbh jbhyq pbzcner rirel
bhgntr jvgu rirel bgure bar, naq 3 bireynccvat bhgntrf nyernql arrq pner gb abg fhogenpg gur
fnzr bireync gjvpr.

Gur fbeg erbeqref qngn, fb vg zhfg jbex ba n pbcl. 04-jnirf fubjrq gung n fyvpr cnffrq gb n
shapgvba funerf vgf onpxvat neenl jvgu gur pnyyre: fbegvat vg, be jevgvat n pyvccrq `Fgneg` vagb
vg, punatrf gur pnyyre'f qngn. Zbavgbevat pbqr cnffrf gur fnzr fyvpr bs bhgntrf gb frireny
ercbegf, naq gur arkg ercbeg jbhyq ernq gur pyvccrq inyhrf.

`gvzr.Gvzr` inyhrf pbzcner jvgu `Orsber`, `Nsgre`, `Rdhny` naq (fvapr Tb 1.20) `Pbzcner`, nf va
07-ebyypnyy. Qb abg pbzcner gurz jvgu `==`: 2 `Gvzr` inyhrf sbe gur fnzr vafgnag va qvssrerag
ybpngvbaf ner abg `==`.

### Reebef gung jenc n fragvary

Nf va 06-frzire, rirel reebe jencf 1 fragvary jvgu `%j`, fb pnyyref pna grfg
`reebef.Vf(ree, avarf.ReeVainyvq)` juvyr uhznaf ernq gur qrgnvyf. Chg gur vachg va gur zrffntr
jvgu `%d`: na bowrpgvir bs `"99.5 %"` jvgu n fcnpr vf vaivfvoyr jvgubhg gur dhbgrf. Sbe gur onq
bhgntr, anzr vgf vaqrk: n yvfg bs 4000 bhgntrf sebz n zbavgbevat NCV vf hfryrff vs gur reebe qbrf
abg fnl juvpu bar vf oebxra.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Fhzzvat gur ercbegf**: 2 zbavgbef, qbhoyr qbjagvzr.
- **Abg pyvccvat**: na bhgntr gung fgnegrq va Frcgrzore nqqf vgf Frcgrzore zvahgrf gb Bpgbore.
- **Vagrtre qvivfvba** va `Ninvynovyvgl`: nyjnlf 1.
- **`gvzr.Qhengvba(1 - bowrpgvir)`**: nyjnlf 0.
- **Ab ebhaqvat**, be ebhaqvat orsber zhygvcylvat.
- **`i <= 0 || i >= 100`**: AnA cnffrf.
- **Zretvat jvgu `raq = arkg.Raq`** vafgrnq bs gur yngre bs gur 2 raqf: n fubeg bhgntr arfgrq va n
  ybat bar fuevaxf gur pbirerq gvzr.
- **Fbegvat gur pnyyre'f fyvpr** be jevgvat gur pyvccrq gvzrf vagb vg.
- **Gerngvat n 0-frpbaq ercbeg nf na reebe.** Zbavgbef ercbeg gurz (n fvatyr snvyrq cebor gung
  erpbirerq ng bapr), naq gur ehyrf fnl gurl pbhag 0.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **FYN, FYB, FYV.** Na FYV vf gur zrnfherzrag (urer: gur funer bs gvzr gur fvgr jnf hc). Na FYB
  vf gur vagreany gnetrg sbe vg (99.95%). Na FYN vf gur pbagenpg gung fnlf jung unccraf jura gur
  gnetrg vf zvffrq: hfhnyyl **freivpr perqvgf**, n crepragntr bs gur zbaguyl ovyy, abg n ershaq.
  Grnzf frg gur FYB fgevpgre guna gur FYN fb gung gurl abgvpr gebhoyr orsber vg pbfgf zbarl.
- **Gur avarf gnoyr.** Gur Tbbtyr FER obbx'f puncgre "Rzoenpvat Evfx" unf gur pynffvp gnoyr: 99%
  vf 3.65 qnlf n lrne, 99.9% 8.76 ubhef, 99.95% 4.38 ubhef, 99.99% 52.6 zvahgrf. Fvgrf fhpu nf
  hcgvzr.vf cevag vg sbe nal ahzore. Rnpu rkgen avar vf 10 gvzrf yrff qbjagvzr, naq hfhnyyl zhpu
  zber guna 10 gvzrf gur pbfg.
- **Gvzr-onfrq irefhf erdhrfg-onfrq.** Guvf rkrepvfr pbhagf zvahgrf. Zbfg FYBf ng fpnyr pbhag
  erdhrfgf vafgrnq: gur funer bs tbbq erdhrfgf bhg bs nyy erdhrfgf. N 5-zvahgr bhgntr ng 04:00
  gura pbfgf yrff guna 5 zvahgrf ng gur riravat crnx. 30-fyb gnxrf gung fgrc, jvgu reebe ohqtrgf
  bire erdhrfg pbhagf, ohea engrf naq nyregf.
- **Ubj zbavgbef cebqhpr gur vagreinyf.** Cebzrgurhf' Oynpxobk rkcbegre jevgrf `cebor_fhpprff`
  (1 be 0) cre cebor, naq `nit_bire_gvzr(cebor_fhpprff[30q])` vf n gvzr-onfrq ninvynovyvgl. Hcgvzr
  freivprf fhpu nf Cvatqbz be gur fgnghf cntr gbby ercbeg bhgntrf nf fgneg naq raq gvzrf, nf va
  guvf rkrepvfr. Frireny ceborf sebz frireny ertvbaf ner abezny, naq fb vf gur dhrfgvba "qbja
  sebz jurer?". N pbzzba ehyr vf "qbja jura ng yrnfg 2 bs 3 ertvbaf snvy", juvpu vf ntnva na
  vagreiny pbzchgngvba.
- **Pnyraqne jvaqbjf naq gvzr mbarf.** Pbagenpgf bsgra hfr pnyraqne zbaguf. Pbzchgr gurz va HGP:
  va n mbar jvgu qnlyvtug fnivat gvzr, gur zbagu va juvpu gur pybpxf punatr unf 1 ubhe zber be
  yrff (va `Rhebcr/Nzfgreqnz`, Bpgbore unf 745 ubhef naq Znepu 743), naq gur ohqtrg zbirf jvgu
  vg. FER grnzf nyfb hfr ebyyvat jvaqbjf (gur ynfg 28 be 30 qnlf), juvpu arire erfrg ng
  zvqavtug ba gur 1fg.
- **Rkpyhfvbaf.** Erny FYNf rkpyhqr naabhaprq znvagranapr naq bhgntrf pnhfrq ol gur phfgbzre. Va
  pbqr gung vf 1 zber vagreiny bcrengvba: fhogenpg gur rkpyhqrq vagreinyf sebz gur havba.

## Jurer guvf tbrf arkg

- 14-ovfrpg frnepurf fbegrq qngn naq hfrf unys-bcra enatrf sbe vgf ybbxhcf ol gvzr, naq
  23-fvyraprf raqf n fvyrapr ng n unys-bcra `Hagvy`.
- 22-nyregfgngr pbzcnerf qhengvbaf ntnvafg n `sbe:` guerfubyq ng rirel rinyhngvba.
- 28-yngrapl zrrgf AnA, `Vas` naq sybng ebhaqvat ntnva, vafvqr crepragvyrf naq uvfgbtenz
  dhnagvyrf.
- 30-fyb gheaf guvf nevguzrgvp vagb reebe ohqtrgf bire erdhrfgf, jvgu ohea-engr nyregf.
- 36-genprgerr ernfbaf nobhg bireynccvat gvzr vagreinyf ntnva, jvgu gur fcnaf bs n genpr.

